{
  "id": "point-4-2",
  "title": "What are Specifications For?",
  "shortSummary": "说明 specification 在沟通、契约、验证与变更控制中的用途，以及不写规格的代价。",
  "keyTerms": [
    "specification",
    "契约",
    "沟通",
    "变更控制"
  ],
  "animationType": "none",
